 ## Run it
 
 ```bash
-docker compose up -d                      # PostgreSQL on localhost:5432 (LENDING_DB_PORT overrides)
+docker compose up -d db                   # PostgreSQL alone on localhost:5432 (LENDING_DB_PORT overrides)
