 ```
 
+Or run all of it in containers - the database, the migrations, the API on `localhost:8080`
+(`LENDING_API_PORT` overrides) and the worker:
+
+```bash
+docker compose up --build                 # the migrations run first, on every start
+docker compose down -v                    # stops everything and deletes the database volume
+```
