+
+In `docker compose up` the migrations run as their own step before the API and the worker start, from the
+migration bundle `src/LendingDesk.Data/Dockerfile` builds; the worker image is `src/LendingDesk.Worker/Dockerfile`:
+
+```bash
+docker build -f src/LendingDesk.Worker/Dockerfile -t lendingdesk-worker .
+docker build -f src/LendingDesk.Data/Dockerfile -t lendingdesk-migrations .
+docker run lendingdesk-migrations --connection '<the same connection string>'
+```
